<BOA> Scaling study base config — derived per-size from this template
// Base 1x is the retro sweep config: 14x14x0.5 µm bed @ 500/µm² (~98K motors),
// 400 random filaments. Scaling by N: boxXY = 14*sqrt(N), initialFilaments = 400*N,
// density held constant so motor count = 500 * boxXY^2.
// runTime is overridden by the harness via K1/K2.
